<SiteLayout title="Contact VYQDA Technologies | Discuss a Software Project" description="Discuss custom software development, SaaS product engineering, business automation or VYQDA software products with our team." canonical="https://vyqda.com/contact/" active="contact">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero__inner"><p class="page-eyebrow">CONTACT VYQDA</p><h1>Tell us what you are trying to <em>make better.</em></h1><p class="page-hero__lead">A useful first conversation starts with the business challenge. Share the workflow, users, constraints and outcome you have in mind.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss Your Requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button--secondary" href="/products/">Explore Products</a></div></div></section>
<section class="content-section" id="project-enquiry"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading-page"><p class="section-kicker">START A CONVERSATION</p><h2>What would you like to solve?</h2><p>Use these prompts to prepare a clear project brief. You do not need a complete specification to begin.</p></div><div class="contact-grid"><article class="contact-method"><span class="page-card__number">01</span><h3>Custom software or application</h3><p>Describe the process, users, systems to connect and what a successful outcome would look like.</p><a href="/services/">Review development services ↗</a></article><article class="contact-method"><span class="page-card__number">02</span><h3>Existing software support</h3><p>Outline the current application, the issues you are seeing and the improvements you need.</p><a href="/about/#approach">See how we work ↗</a></article><article class="contact-method"><span class="page-card__number">03</span><h3>VYQDA software products</h3><p>Tell us the product you are considering, the team size or workflow, and any important requirements.</p><a href="/products/">Explore products ↗</a></article><article class="contact-method"><span class="page-card__number">04</span><h3>Prepare a project brief</h3><p>Include your business context, key problem, intended users, preferred timeline and known integrations.</p><p class="form-note">We have not added a non-functional enquiry form. A real form should be connected to an inbox or CRM before launch.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="content-section content-section--tint"><div class="wrap page-split"><div><div class="section-heading-page"><p class="section-kicker">WHAT HAPPENS NEXT</p><h2>A practical discussion, not a sales script.</h2></div></div><ol class="page-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Understand the need</strong><p>Clarify the current workflow and the outcome you want.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Identify options</strong><p>Consider a product, integration, tailored build or phased approach.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Agree a sensible next step</strong><p>Outline the scope that needs to be understood before making commitments.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
</SiteLayout>